      "canonical_url": "https://www.carboncrusher.com/news/road-refurbishment",
      "title": "Road Refurbishment",
      "summary": "Our proven method recycles 100% of your existing road material on-site—eliminating the need for new raw materials, slashing emissions, and speeding up construction. Paired with our patented, plant-based BioBinder, we replace fossil-based bitumen and permanently store carbon in the road itself.",
      "published_at": null,
      "fetched_at": "2026-07-28T21:36:14.883471+00:00",
