      "canonical_url": "https://www.carboncrusher.com/news/carbon-credits",
      "title": "Carbon Credits",
      "summary": "Carbon Crusher’s BioBinders lock captured CO₂ into road materials, while regenerative roadsides actively sequester even more carbon. Our Carbon Removal Credits (CRCs)—currently pending verification by Verra—allow you to support the transition to sustainable, climate-positive infrastructure. Partner with us to reshape the world’s largest infrastructure. Your CRC investment accelerates the rollout of low-carbon road technology, driving real impact in the fight against climate change and delivering long-lasting, high-performance roads.",
      "published_at": null,
