      "title": "CRAAS Construction Partners",
      "summary": "Through the Carbon Crusher Partner Program, you gain access to our cutting-edge Full Depth Reclamation process, powerful mobile Crushers, sustainable BioBinders, and the intelligent SkyRoadsAI pavement management system—all delivered in one streamlined, cost-effective package.Our partnership isn’t just about tools. It’s about full support from our expert team of Green Jackets and the know-how to deliver high-performance, climate-positive roads with a truly unique product offering.",
