      "title": "Y-Combinator features the Carbon Rover",
      "summary": "A lot has happened since Carbon Crusher became a Y Combinator company. The Carbon Rover is a first-of-its-kind autonomous crusher and mixer that revolutionizes road construction by processing and improving existing road materials directly on site.",
